      "created_at": "2024-07-10T10:06:09.490Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sudhanshu\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"128373\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/sudhanshu/48/68856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sudhanshu:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’d like to <strong>rename the core doctype “Project” to “Program”</strong> for better clarity. However, I understand that core doctypes are not directly editable.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>For that case, we suggest changing name via Customize Form, so please check it.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/2/02054f3f97a6c9a6fd1c23516d1180d2d6529698.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/02054f3f97a6c9a6fd1c23516d1180d2d6529698\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/02054f3f97a6c9a6fd1c23516d1180d2d6529698_2_690x348.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hSkuWgCQzgGONo9UYAMrGfjBhe\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/02054f3f97a6c9a6fd1c23516d1180d2d6529698_2_690x348.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/02054f3f97a6c9a6fd1c23516d1180d2d6529698_2_1035x522.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/02054f3f97a6c9a6fd1c23516d1180d2d6529698_2_1380x696.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×969 54 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I will automatically apply the entire erpnext (Project → Program) without any problem. And it’s searchable too. But don’t change the name in the database.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/7/d7cbfa091ed4d3513b8cf7b879d25b7bf3b416b8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d7cbfa091ed4d3513b8cf7b879d25b7bf3b416b8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7cbfa091ed4d3513b8cf7b879d25b7bf3b416b8_2_690x348.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uN1FNG9WCGh8WJeqGMZyDdhABte\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7cbfa091ed4d3513b8cf7b879d25b7bf3b416b8_2_690x348.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7cbfa091ed4d3513b8cf7b879d25b7bf3b416b8_2_1035x522.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d7cbfa091ed4d3513b8cf7b879d25b7bf3b416b8_2_1380x696.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F7FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×969 55.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
